{{Descriptions AoC}}
Flamebreaker Boots are a piece of [[Attire]] that can only be worn by [[Link]], and they are obtained by completing the [[Challenge]] "[[Tough Bulwark of the Gorons]]". They can also be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

